// EXPECT: panic
// EXPECT-PANIC-CONTAINS: panic at panic_source_location.saw:8: boom

// design 69: a runtime `panic` names its source location — "panic at FILE:LINE:
// {message}" — threaded through the saw_panic seam. The FILE is the calling
// function's source basename and LINE is the panic call-site line (here 8).
func main() {
    panic("boom")
}
